      "id": "case-body",
      "type": "richText",
      "content": {
        "format": "html",
        "html": "<h2>The challenge</h2><p>Two years of receipts in a shoebox, three bank accounts and a tax deadline in eight weeks.</p><h2>What we did</h2><ul><li>Connected every account to a bank feed.</li><li>Photographed and matched 1,400 receipts.</li><li>Rebuilt the chart of accounts.</li></ul><h2>The result</h2><p>Reconciled books, a tax return filed on time and a monthly routine that takes the owner ten minutes.</p>"
      }
